  "id": "daylight",
  "name": "Daylight",
  "tagline": "Light high above swelling slowly, a bright open chord, an even rolling bass.",
  "description": "Open fifths high above, each swelling in and out on its own clock; a bright, open chord in the pad; clean air. A soft, round four-four; an even rolling bass; light sixteenth ticks; open chords now and then.",
  "use": {
    "name": "Execute",
    "for": "Getting through many small tasks: email, admin, lists.",
    "why": "A brighter, more forward state for quick, repeated actions: an even, rolling pulse that sets a working tempo, and an open, bright colour (mode moves mood; tempo moves arousal), with nothing sudden. The light far above swells and fades on its own slow clocks: something bright to sit in, never an event. It builds quickly."
  },
